  (label "+5V_PB"
    (at 44.45 35.56 270)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom))
    (uuid "1bbf99a9-d9ac-495d-896d-7d90258b94b0")
  )
  (label "GND"
    (at 54.61 35.56 270)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom))
    (uuid "d36646a9-63ef-4d88-b6a8-07157657a0f4")
  )
  (text "NOTES (Rev A - design for review, not yet bench-validated)\n1. Module headers M1-M3: pin1 VCC, pin2 GND, pin3 OUT. Electrode leads plug into each BioAmp module.\n2. Power bank 5 V -> ESP32 VIN (on-board 3V3 feeds MCU, ToF, IMU); MCP1700 gives a separate 3V3_AFE.\n3. Analog inputs use ADC1 only (GPIO34/35/36) so Wi-Fi/BT cannot block sampling. 1k + 100nF = 1.6 kHz RC.\n4. Electrodes only on battery power - never while USB is tied to a mains-powered PC. Not a medical device."
    (at 20 168 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e227b537-c3e8-41f9-a355-8f9af3811fc7"))
